    ('Modifies the parameters of an IPv6 connection (wired or Wi-Fi). If a SSID value is not…', 'luna-send -n 1 -f luna://com.webos.service.connectionmanager/setipv6 \'{ "ssid": "MyTestAP", "method": "manual", "address": "2001:db8:85a3:8d3:1319:8a2e:370:7348" }', ''),
