    ('Performs an ARP request to resolve IP address to mac address which can then be used to…', 'luna-send -n 1 -f luna://com.webos.service.nettools/arping \'{ "ifName":"eth0", "ipAddress":"10.195.248.213" }', ''),
    ('Creates a TCP socket and checks if it can successfully connect to the hostURL using the…', 'luna-send -n 1 -f luna://com.webos.service.nettools/checkhttp \'{ "hostUrl":"www.lge.com" }', ''),
