    ('Allows you to query the status of a particular cache type to obtain: the total space…', 'luna-send -f -n 1 luna://com.webos.service.filecache/DefineType \'{"typeName":"test", "size":1024, "loWatermark":102400, "hiWatermark":409600, "cost":5}\'', ''),
